NEARS-1291 — HIGH/CRITICAL: multi-store checkout get-Tax 403 INFINITE LOOP
=====================================================================
Repro: log in James Wilson (user 1) -> 2-store basket (Nears Mart #1 + Fresh Mart #2) -> Proceed to Checkout.
Observed LIVE (emulator-5556, worktree build feat/NEARS-1291): 20,712 POST /api/v1/customer/order/get-Tax calls,
EVERY ONE http_status=403, during a SINGLE checkout view; persistent "Please select items from the same store"
error snackbar overlays the Place Order CTA; Order Summary tax component stays 0; backend eventually rate-limits (429).

Flutter log (representative tail):
  [NET] POST endpoint=/api/v1/customer/order/get-Tax
  [NET] endpoint=/api/v1/customer/order/get-Tax http_status=403
  [FAIL] endpoint=/api/v1/customer/order/get-Tax http_status=403 type=ApiFailure correlation_id=...
  (x20,712, unbounded until you navigate away)

ROOT CAUSE (code-confirmed, worktree):
  1. checkout_controller.triggerOrderTaxIfNeeded (L1566-1640) builds a SINGLE-store PlaceOrderBodyModel for a
     multi-store basket: store_id = cartList[0].item.storeId (first store only), then POSTs order/get-Tax.
  2. Backend getCalculatedTax (PlaceNewOrder.php L1734) loads the SERVER-side Cart (spans BOTH stores) and
     makeOrderDetails (L1112) rejects: $product->store_id != $order->store_id -> 403 code=different_stores
     "Please select items from the same store".
  3. getOrderTax (L1264-1281) on non-200 resets _calledOrderTax=false while _isFirstTime only flips to false on
     200 -> triggerOrderTaxIfNeeded re-dispatches on EVERY GetBuilder rebuild -> unbounded 403 retry loop.

PROOF the 403 is the cross-store server Cart: after group/place consumed user 1's cart (cart now 0 rows), an
identical get-Tax body returns HTTP 200 tax_amount:0 — i.e. the 403 only occurs while the 2-store cart exists.

IMPACT: breaks the multi-store checkout — perpetual error toast on the CTA, tax stuck at 0, thousands of failed
calls per view, backend 429. FE-2 must not call the single-store get-Tax for a multi-store basket (compute tax
per-store like fees, or guard the single-store get-Tax when _isMultiStoreCart).
